WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.991 --> 00:00:05.522
Emily · Agent: Good afternoon, you're through to Emily at Holcim. How can I help?

2
00:00:05.931 --> 00:00:21.764
Jamie · Customer: Alright Emily. I need to sort some concrete for next Tuesday. Doing an extension and doing a new driveway in Somerset. Building control is being a bit of a nightmare though, so I want to make sure I get the right mix for the footings. What do you reckon?

3
00:00:30.061 --> 00:00:45.861
Emily · Agent: Not a problem at all. For standard extension footings, building control usually looks for a GEN3 mix, or an RC35 mix if the ground is a bit tricky. I can quote you for the RC35 just to be on the safe side?

4
00:00:46.861 --> 00:00:53.679
Jamie · Customer: Yeah, let's go with the RC35. Better safe than sorry. Need about 15 cubes.

5
00:00:55.211 --> 00:01:13.371
Emily · Agent: Got it. 15 cubic metres of RC35. Now, since you mentioned doing a new driveway as well, have you got your base materials sorted yet? We can send over some MOT Type 1 from our local quarry on the same delivery day.

6
00:01:14.321 --> 00:01:25.400
Jamie · Customer: Oh right, actually no, I haven't sorted that. I'll probably need about 20 tonnes of Type 1. What about the actual asphalt? Do you do that too?

7
00:01:26.501 --> 00:01:37.661
Emily · Agent: We do. For a residential drive, I'd highly recommend our SuperDrive Asphalt. It handles power steering scuffs really well. I can put it all on one quote for you?

8
00:01:38.651 --> 00:01:43.630
Jamie · Customer: Yeah, brilliant. Saves me ringing round. Chuck it all on an email.

9
00:01:44.801 --> 00:01:50.521
Emily · Agent: I'll put that quote together and email it over. Is there anything else I can help with?

10
00:01:51.491 --> 00:01:54.207
Jamie · Customer: No, that's everything, thanks. Have a great day.

11
00:01:55.321 --> 00:01:57.641
Emily · Agent: You too, Jamie. Bye.
